{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的大块能直接交代人物此刻的处境、动机和变化，发烧后握手、取消见面、深夜敲门、月底搬走等具体事件也让整条故事线更连贯；Y 的大字多是抽出的情绪短语，单独扫读时因果和情境不够完整，而且删去了几处重要情节。small、fine：X 的小字更多落在人物具体的身体反应和当下体验上，如话到嘴边咽回去、喉咙发紧、肩膀松下来、眼眶发热，补充效果比较直接；Y 不少小字转向声部、落音、琶音等音乐本身的描述，部分抽象，未必能留下同样具体的观众感受。concise、human：X 的叙述整体更直接口语，虽然意象有些多，但 Y 在 S11 连续用不再藏着喜欢、不再为它道歉、没什么不好表达相近意思，且忘了藏好喜欢的搭配不够自然，气味、身体感觉、幻想、遗憾和快感混在一起则有明显的抽象名词堆叠感；load：Y 的强调词虽然数量较多，但每块短，整体大字阅读量明显小于 X 的整句大块，短停留屏尤其更容易扫完。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "18f3dca1-1bde-4b3a-9866-f6c4170adf3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T235553207549Z", "elapsed_seconds": 171.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T23:58:44.730565+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "85694fe38c407bf65aaec22271b2462ef6fb23ee59c4ebc4d035b2cb5baa2b32", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": 